cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the repository and the associated manuscript."
title: "Pentagon Air-Shower Directional Analysis and Reproducibility Code"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Motahari
    given-names: Fowad
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-11
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility-oriented Python and simulation code for the analysis of a
  five-detector pentagon air-shower array, including event reconstruction,
  directional statistics, Monte Carlo calibration, source-family tests, and
  targeted CORSIKA/Geant4 detector-response studies.
keywords:
  - cosmic rays
  - extensive air showers
  - astroparticle physics
  - Monte Carlo
  - reproducibility
  - CORSIKA
  - Geant4
